## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1 — Blockchain Smart Contract

> Build the foundation first — the immutable verification layer.

#### [NEW] `blockchain/contracts/ProofOfReality.sol`
Solidity smart contract with:
- `registerVerification(verificationId, contentHash, realityScore, verdict, timestamp)` — stores verification on-chain
- `getVerification(verificationId)` — retrieves verification record
- `verifyContentHash(verificationId, contentHash)` — checks if a given hash matches the stored hash
- Events: `VerificationRegistered` emitted on each new registration
- Owner-controlled access (only the backend can register)

#### [NEW] `blockchain/hardhat.config.js`
Hardhat configuration targeting Polygon Amoy testnet (Chain ID 80002), with etherscan verification support.

#### [NEW] `blockchain/scripts/deploy.js`
Deployment script using Hardhat Ignition or classic deployment pattern.

#### [NEW] `blockchain/test/ProofOfReality.test.js`
Unit tests for the smart contract — register, retrieve, and verify.

---

### Phase 2 — Python AI Forensic Engine

> The analysis microservice that processes uploaded content.

#### [NEW] `ai-engine/main.py`
FastAPI application with:
- `POST /analyze` — accepts file upload, runs all analyzers, returns Reality Score
- `GET /health` — health check endpoint
- CORS configured for Next.js frontend

#### [NEW] `ai-engine/analyzers/video_analyzer.py`
Video analysis module:
- Frame extraction via FFmpeg
- Frame-to-frame consistency analysis
- Face region detection and anomaly scoring
- Temporal consistency checks

#### [NEW] `ai-engine/analyzers/image_analyzer.py`
Image analysis module:
- Format validation and magic byte checking
- EXIF metadata extraction
- Compression artifact analysis
- AI generation pattern detection (based on statistical features)

#### [NEW] `ai-engine/analyzers/audio_analyzer.py`
Audio analysis module:
- Audio stream extraction from video
- Spectral analysis for synthetic voice markers
- Bitrate and encoding consistency

#### [NEW] `ai-engine/analyzers/metadata_analyzer.py`
Metadata analysis module:
- Timestamp consistency (creation vs modification)
- Device/software information extraction
- Edit history detection
- GPS/location data extraction

#### [NEW] `ai-engine/analyzers/score_engine.py`
Reality Score computation:
- Weighted combination of all analyzer outputs
- Configurable weights per analysis category
- Verdict classification (High Confidence → Highly Likely Manipulated)
- Confidence breakdown per metric

#### [NEW] `ai-engine/utils/media_processor.py`
FFmpeg wrapper utilities for frame extraction, audio extraction, and probe metadata.

