## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
# Smart contract tests
cd blockchain && npx hardhat test

# AI engine (manual test via curl)
cd ai-engine && python -m pytest tests/ -v

# Frontend build validation
cd frontend && npm run build
```

### Manual Verification
1. **Upload Flow**: Upload a sample image/video → verify AI analysis runs → score displays correctly
2. **Blockchain**: Confirm transaction appears on [Amoy Polygonscan](https://amoy.polygonscan.com/)
3. **Certificate**: Verify certificate generates with correct data and QR code
4. **Public Verification**: Enter Verification ID → confirm stored data matches → re-upload same file → confirm hash matches → upload different file → confirm hash mismatch warning
5. **End-to-End**: Complete user journey from upload → certificate → public verification

