## Design Direction

The UI will feature a **dark theme with cyberpunk/trust aesthetics**:
- Deep navy/dark background (`#0a0f1e`)
- Neon accent gradients (cyan `#00d4ff` → purple `#7b2ff7`)
- Glassmorphism cards with `backdrop-blur`
- Animated score gauges with SVG
- Holographic certificate borders
- Smooth page transitions with Framer Motion
- Inter/Outfit font from Google Fonts
- Micro-animations on hover and state changes

This creates a premium, "trust infrastructure" feel appropriate for a security/verification product.
